>=C2=A0 A side note: we will also upload the Markdown file of this draft into t=
he same git=20

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0>=C2=A0 repository at https://github.com/alipay/tls13-sm-spec l=
ater to make it a totally

=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0 >=C2=A0 public involved progress.

=20

I think this is exactly what was needed/asked-for. Thank you!



On Aug 19, 2019, at 7:51 PM, Kepeng Li <kepeng.lkp@alibaba-inc.com> wrote:

=20

Currently, we uploaded some of the referenced documents here:

https://github.com/alipay/tls13-sm-spec

=20

@Rene, Parts 1 and 3 can be found in the link above.

=20

Hope it helps.

=20

Thanks,

=20

Kind Regards

Kepeng

=20

